[79.334704, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe install exceeds the 30s command limit, so I’ll run it in the background and poll its log.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && nohup pip install --no-cache-dir torch transformers peft accelerate sentencepiece protobuf safetensors > /app/pip_install.log 2>&1 & echo $! > \r\n/app/pip.pid; echo \"started $(cat /app/pip.pid)\"\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
