[249.278284, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe adapter targets 20 languages and explicitly saves the `classifier` module, so loading the base with `num_labels=20` before attaching the adapter is \r\ncritical. I’ll verify checkpoint key shapes and then write the full pipeline.\r\n\r\n```\r\npython - <<'PY'\r\nimport torch\r\nsd=torch.load('/app/downloads/adapter/adapter_model.bin', map_location='cpu', weights_only=True)\r\nfor k,v in sd.items():\r\n    print(k, tuple(v.shape) if hasattr(v,'shape') else type(v))\r\nprint('num keys',len(sd))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[250.200693, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[250.201354, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.0.attention.self.query.lora_A.weight (8, 768)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.0.attention.self.query.lora_B.weight (768, 8)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.0.attention.self.value.lora_A.weight (8, 768)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.0.attention.self.value.lora_B.weight (768, 8)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.1.attention.self.query.lora_A.weight (8, 768)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.1.attention.self.query.lora_B.weight (768, 8)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.1.attention.self.value.lora_A.weight (8, 768)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.1.attention.self.value.lora_B.weight (768, 8)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.2.attention.self.query.lora_A.weight (8, 768)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.2.attention.self.query.lora_B.weight (768, 8)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.2.attention.self.value.lora_A.weight (8, 768)\r\nbase_model.model.roberta.encoder.layer.2.attention."]
