[290.639252, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m18\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[290.639788, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe pipeline completed and predicted known language IDs via argmax. I’ll now validate that the merged model’s logits exactly match the adapter model’s logits, \r\nand confirm the saved artifacts/JSON are well-formed.\r\n\r\n```\r\npython - <<'PY'\r\nimport json, os, torch\r\nfrom transformers import AutoModelForSequenceClassification, AutoTokenizer\r\nfrom peft import PeftModel\r\nbase='/app/downloads/base'; adapter='/app/downloads/adapter'; merged='/app/merged_model'\r\ntok=AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(merged)\r\ntexts=[\r\n\"Bonjour, comment allez-vous aujourd'hui?\",\r\n\"Hola, ¿cómo estás hoy?\",\r\n\"Guten Tag, wie geht es Ihnen?\",\r\n\"Ciao, come stai oggi?\",\r\n\"Olá, como você está?\",\r\n\"Привет, как дела?\",\r\n\"こんにちは、お元気ですか？\",\r\n\"你好，你好吗？\",\r\n\"مرحبا، كيف حالك؟\",\r\n\"Hello, how are you?\",\r\n]\r\nm=AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(merged).eval()\r\nb=AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(base, num_labels=20, ignore_mismatched_sizes=True)\r"]
[290.639795, "o", "\np=PeftModel.from_pretrained(b, adapter).eval()\r\nwith torch.no_grad():\r\n  logits_m=[]; logits_p=[]\r\n  for t in texts:\r\n    x=tok(t, return_tensors='pt', truncation=True, max_length=512)\r\n    logits_m.append(m(**x).logits)\r\n    logits_p.append(p(**x).logits)\r\n  lm=torch.cat(logits_m); lp=torch.cat(logits_p)\r\nprint('merged num_labels:', m.config.num_labels)\r\nprint('max abs logit difference merged vs adapter:', (lm-lp).abs().max().item())\r\nprint('argmax equal:', torch.equal(lm.argmax(-1), lp.argmax(-1)))\r\nprint('allclose:', torch.allclose(lm, lp, atol=1e-5, rtol=1e-4))\r\nprint('artifacts:')\r\nfor d in ['/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base','/app/merged_model']:\r\n    print(d, sorted(os.listdir(d)))\r\nwith open('/app/detection_results.json', encoding='utf-8') as f:\r\n    data=json.load(f)\r\nprint('result count:', len(data), 'keys:', sorted(data[0]), 'ids:', [x['predicted_class_id'] for x in data])\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[290.640025, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
